  "sections": {
    "body4": {
      "type": "rosalia-funnel-block",
      "settings": {
        "rnum": "",
        "eyebrow": "",
        "heading": "The fourth isn’t a nutrient",
        "anchor_id": "",
        "container": "measure",
        "top_rule": false,
        "padding_top": 8,
        "padding_bottom": 8,
        "background": "#FAF5F0",
        "text_color": "#2B2620"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "paragraph1": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>The first three you can measure or supplement. The fourth you can’t — which is why it’s rarely named.</p>",
            "is_lead": false
          }
        },
        "paragraph2": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p><b>It’s the floor under your nervous system, and it’s built out of sleep.</b></p>",
            "is_lead": false
          }
        },
        "paragraph3": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>On sleep debt, skin reacts faster — to heat, stress, a warm room. And it settles slower afterward.</p>",
            "is_lead": false
          }
        },
        "paragraph4": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Weaning can’t touch it. A baby who’s stopped feeding hasn’t necessarily started sleeping. The sleep debt can outlast the feeding by a year.</p>",
            "is_lead": false
          }
        },
        "paragraph5": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>It’s also why the other three keep slipping. Each is rebuilt during sleep.</p>",
            "is_lead": false
          }
        },
        "paragraph6": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p><b>So the useful question isn’t what to put on your face.</b> It’s which of the four is furthest down. Put the wrong one back first, and you get a shelf of half-used bottles.</p>",
            "is_lead": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "paragraph1",
        "paragraph2",
        "paragraph3",
        "paragraph4",
        "paragraph5",
        "paragraph6"
      ]
    }
  },
